		<section deliveryTarget="except_digital">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>Move the wiper speed control switch to <term translate="no">OFF</term> (0) position.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Pull the lever gently toward you to spray washer fluid on the windshield.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ol>
				<li>
					<p>Move the wiper speed control switch to <term translate="no">OFF</term> (0) position.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Pull the lever gently toward you to spray washer fluid on the windshield.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>Operate the wipers so they perform several cycles.</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>
